            <div xml:id="d49">

                <pb facs="0083" n="29" sameAs="frus:frus1944Quebec/pg29"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Roosevelt Papers</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President to the War Shipping Administrator</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Land</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hyde
                                Park</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian" when="1944-09-02"
                            >September 2, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum for Admiral
                    Land</hi></p>
                <p>I have not heard anything about the proposed personnel if the Prime Minister
                    comes over but if he brings Lord Leathers you must, of course, come to Quebec. I
                    will let you know shortly. Meantime, will you keep yourself in readiness to come
                    to Quebec, leaving the ninth or tenth?</p>
                <closer><signed>F[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ranklin</hi>] D. R[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">oosevelt</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
